# seed: 1
# requires: hero_ready scene_enter minigame_arm minigame_open minigame_slots_spin minigame_slots_result
#
# Slobber Slots (GAME 1) at the retail casino.
#
# WHERE THE CASINO IS, from the retail data and not from docs/gap_analysis.md (which says
# "scene 4" - scene 4 is an unreachable template; docs/re/script.md section 8 is right that
# the only real GAME opcodes live in the per-map scene files):
#     SCENE 1005  aztec                       extracted/worlds/Evergreen/QuestScenes1000.txt:93
#         THEME 0 / ACTOR 1 "Barker" / SEL 1 / MOVE 1,15,80
#         GAME 1                              QuestScenes1000.txt:99
#         ' Try your luck! / ' Our slots pay the most!
#         END
# Ten more identical casinos live in the same file, plus the SCENE 4 template at
# quest.txt:1720. The one that is actually on a map is reached from map 2:
#     map=2(castle1) link=3 x=264 y=267 kind=1 dest=0 target=1005 diff=1 name=Casino
# and map 2 is Macgyver Castle, entered from map 0 link 9 "Macgyver Castle" at (151,275).
#
# THE LEGS. Arrow-key walking is the original's own cell-at-a-time walk (mapview.c:908-917
# re-issues click_walk(hero + dir) exactly as the click would), so `hold DIR n` is ordinary
# walking and stops when the terrain does. Each hold below is 4 frames per map cell:
#   * The Gateway of Dreams is answered on the way out, not walked past. quest.txt:1774 is
#     `ASK 30` - the golden rule - and an ASK suspends the scene until the player answers, so
#     the script answers it the way a player does, with Y (scene.c's ST_ASK sets the reply to
#     "YES"). The Soul Brother also hands over L1 / H5000 / M5000, opens the `OFFER2 0,10`
#     shop and sizes the trophy bag to 4x3, so this is a real visit.
#   * The 101-unit walk to the castle is done east first: `click 19 40` aims at (142,177) and
#     the path builder routes the hero south-west until FUN_0046260E's per-tick roll fires.
#     The fight is won, which places the hero above map 0 link 9 at (151,264) - eleven units
#     from the link - and `click 183 184` is (151,275), the link itself.
#   * On map 2 the hero lands at (158,322), just above the Main Gate. castle1.ter is an
#     82x87 grid over a 328x350 jpg, so a cell is 4x4 pixels and the four holds below are the
#     straight runs a flood fill of that grid gives: east 138 to (296,322), north 35 to
#     (296,287) - the column above (264,287) is walled at y=288..299 - west 32 to (264,287),
#     north into the link. The last hold is deliberately long and the one after it short: the
#     link rectangle is only x 263..265 by y 266..268, and the original fires a link when the
#     hero comes to REST inside it (mapview.c:812-820 clears the latch while the hero is still
#     walking), so the hero has to overshoot the wall and step back down into it.
#
# `GAME n` opens nothing by itself. scene.c's OP_GAME is a comment worth repeating: it
# "does NOT block: FUN_00421529 arms the button, then pc++", so the opcode only arms a scene
# button-bar slot; the click is what opens the dialog. The armed slot is 6, the shared
# Shop/Equip/Game/Missions slot, at button_rect(6) = {640-51-51*6, 59, 48, 48} = {283,59,...};
# scene.c:1372 dispatches it and hands the raw click to minigame_click, which is the path that
# logs minigame_open. The slots window is 176x111 and scene.c:1536 renders it at (0,0), so
# the client rect of SPIN (control 0x447, DLU x=123 y=7 cx=46 cy=12, minigame_slots.c:30-33)
# is the screen rect (123,7,46,12) and its centre is (146,13). The spin charges 10 GP
# (0x466BC6 refuses under 10) and settles by itself, which is what logs
# minigame_slots_result.
#
# MEASURED on this binary (seed 1, fresh build): the whole leg chain runs to
#   EVT link_used map=0 link=9 / EVT link_used map=2 link=3 / EVT scene_enter scene=1005 /
#   EVT minigame_arm game=1 label=' Try your luck! /
#   EVT minigame_slots_open spins=0 won=0 bet=0 / EVT minigame_open game=1 ok=1 /
#   EVT minigame_slots_spin ok=1 bet=10 gold=497 /
#   EVT minigame_slots_result matches=1 symbol=2 pay=0 gold=497 /
#   EVT minigame_disarm game=0
# The eleven `key a` presses in the opening encounter are load-bearing: the walk out of
# the Gateway rolls a distance-44 Green Jelly that survives the first 10-damage hit, so
# the hero needs a second committed action to win. One press is not enough.
# The SPIN click works because scene.c:1364 hands minigame_click the port's left-button
# bit `(in->mouse_pressed&(1u<<1))`, the same mask `hit()` uses for the armed GAME slot at
# 1379 - the slot-6 dispatch that arms the button and the dialog control that spends it
# are now the same device bit.
expect boot_menu 900
# FUN_00402A73's Terms of Service modal opens on entry to the main menu (front.c:534
# tos_gate, consumed at front.c:770) and swallows the next key. "I Accept" is
# tos_accept = (356,371,75,23), so its centre is (393,382).
click 393 382
expect tos_accept 300
key RETURN
wait 30
key RETURN
wait 30
key RETURN
wait 30
key n
wait 5
text Gambler
key RETURN
expect hero_ready 300
expect map_enter 600
keydown DOWN
expect scene_enter 600
keyup DOWN
wait 40
key RETURN
wait 40
key RETURN
wait 40
key RETURN
wait 40
key y
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 40
key RETURN
wait 40
expect panel_open 600
key ESCAPE
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
expect map_enter 2000
# East out of the Gateway, south-west toward the castle, until the encounter roll fires.
click 19 40
expect battle_start 4000
key a
wait 30
key a
wait 30
key a
wait 30
key a
wait 30
key a
wait 30
key a
wait 30
key a
wait 30
key a
wait 30
key a
wait 30
key a
wait 30
key a
wait 30
expect battle_won 4000
expect map_enter 4000
# (151,275) is map 0 link 9, eleven units south of where the fight left the hero.
click 183 184
expect map_enter 3000
# Macgyver Castle, (158,322) -> (264,267) = map 2 link 3.
hold RIGHT 552
hold UP 140
hold LEFT 128
hold UP 200
hold DOWN 40
expect scene_enter 2000
wait 100
shot /tmp/wos-gap-casino.bmp
# The armed GAME button, then the window's own SPIN control.
click 307 32
expect minigame_open 900
shot /tmp/wos-gap-slots-open.bmp
click 146 13
expect minigame_slots_spin 900
expect minigame_slots_result 3000
shot /tmp/wos-gap-slots-result.bmp
quit
